## The Royal Breakfast

Breakfast is served every day from 07:30 to 10:30 at EUR 17.50 per person, in the room at the front of the hotel looking onto Ceintuurbaan. Book direct through this site and you take ten percent off.

There is no restaurant for lunch or dinner, but De Pijp is one of the better neighbourhoods in Amsterdam to be hungry in. Ask at reception and someone will point you to a table.
